WEBVTT

00:20:57.581 --> 00:21:00.855
for all the talk about
how we're all disappearing

00:21:00.879 --> 00:21:03.287
into our isolated technologies,

00:21:03.311 --> 00:21:07.808
we still are living in a culture
that really does expect us to be "on"

00:21:07.832 --> 00:21:09.866
a remarkable percentage of the time,

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:12.724
often with people
who we don't know that well

00:21:12.748 --> 00:21:14.202
or have never even met before.

00:21:14.226 --> 00:21:16.956
Which isn't necessarily
what we're evolved to do,

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:21.022
and so that's difficult for most humans.

00:21:21.046 --> 00:21:23.162
CA: So let's talk about that.

00:21:23.186 --> 00:21:26.574
So, we can agree there is
this large group of people

00:21:26.598 --> 00:21:32.842
who have strong introvert feelings
for at least a good portion of the time.